    "reasoner_response": "Inform the customer that their contract provides rental car reimbursement when their vehicle requires covered repairs. They are eligible for up to $35 per day for a maximum of 10 days per breakdown, starting from the first day of the covered repair, as long as the repair is covered under their contract. Rental vehicles can be obtained from Enterprise Rent-A-Car, the preferred provider. For rental inquiries or reimbursement, they can call 1-800-752-6265. Ask if they would like more details or have any other questions.",
